      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like there's nothing left inside. i used to have so much to say, so much life in everything i made, but now it's just... empty. i'm just going through the motions of a person who doesn't exist anymore. it feels like i'm just a ghost occupying space that someone useful should be using.",
