    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists don't get it though. they want to \"fix\" the sadness, but it's not sadness. it's just that the well is dry. there's no more music, no more words, nothing. the person who could make things is gone. how do you \"connect\" to someone who doesn't exist anymore? it's like trying to talk to a shadow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
